---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17725550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(772) 555-0199';
---
<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge">● FORT PIERCE &amp; ST. LUCIE COUNTY · 24 / 7 EMERGENCY SERVICE</div>
        <h1>MOLD REMOVAL<br />&amp; REMEDIATION IN <span>FORT PIERCE</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Fast Response. Safe Removal. Clean Air Again.</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">When mold appears in your Fort Pierce home or business, every day counts. Our licensed specialists provide thorough inspection, testing, and remediation — with upfront pricing and workmanship you can trust across St. Lucie County.</p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="hero-tag">⏱ Same-Day Response</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">✓ Upfront Pricing</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">📞 24 / 7 Emergency</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🌿 Safe Protocols</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule an Inspection</a>
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-outline">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-icon">🌿</div>
          <h3>See or Smell Mold?</h3>
          <p>We inspect, test, and remediate mold safely — restoring healthy indoor air in Fort Pierce homes and businesses.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Us -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Why Fort Pierce Homeowners <span>Choose Us</span></h2>
        <p>Florida’s humidity and coastal conditions make mold a constant threat. When you discover growth or musty odors, you need a local specialist who responds fast and does the job right the first time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Same-Day Inspection</h3>
          <p>Most inspection and emergency mold calls in Fort Pierce are scheduled the same day — no multi-day waits when health and property are at stake.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📜</div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Certified</h3>
          <p>Our technicians follow industry protocols for assessment, containment, removal, and clearance testing so your property is truly clean.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💵</div>
          <h3>Upfront Pricing, Zero Surprises</h3>
          <p>We explain findings and quote before work begins. No hidden fees, no pressure — just honest mold remediation at fair local rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Local to Fort Pierce</h3>
          <p>Based at 3706 Okeechobee Rd — we know St. Lucie County housing, waterfront properties, and the moisture challenges unique to our area.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>Fast</strong><span>Avg. Response</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>Safe</strong><span>Containment First</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Emergency Available</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problems preview -->
  <section class="section" id="problems">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recognize <span>These Signs?</span></h2>
        <p>Humidity, leaks, and storms accelerate mold growth in Fort Pierce. If you notice any of these, don’t wait.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problems-grid">
        <a href="/problems/visible-mold/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Visible Mold Growth</h3>
          <p>Spots on walls, ceilings, or baseboards signal active growth. Professional containment and removal prevent spread.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/musty-odors/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Musty Odors</h3>
          <p>A persistent earthy or damp smell often means hidden mold behind walls, under floors, or in HVAC systems.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/water-damage/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Water Damage &amp; Leaks</h3>
          <p>Flooding, roof leaks, or plumbing failures create ideal conditions for mold within 24–48 hours.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/allergy-symptoms/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Allergy &amp; Health Symptoms</h3>
          <p>Sneezing, coughing, or irritated eyes that improve when you leave the house may point to indoor mold.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/high-humidity/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>High Humidity</h3>
          <p>Florida humidity above 60% indoors fuels mold. Dehumidification and source control are key.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/black-mold/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Black Mold Concerns</h3>
          <p>Dark growth that looks like black mold should be assessed by professionals — never disturb it yourself.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Expert Mold <span>Services</span></h2>
        <p>From inspection to full remediation and prevention — we handle every step with clear communication.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Assessment</span>
          <h3>Mold Inspection &amp; Testing</h3>
          <p>Visual assessment, moisture mapping, and air or surface sampling when needed to identify the extent and type of growth.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>On-site inspection</li>
            <li>Moisture &amp; humidity checks</li>
            <li>Lab analysis when required</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/mold-inspection/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Core Service</span>
          <h3>Mold Remediation</h3>
          <p>Containment, removal of contaminated materials, cleaning, and treatment so mold does not return.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Proper containment</li>
            <li>Safe removal protocols</li>
            <li>Clearance verification</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/mold-remediation/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Removal</span>
          <h3>Mold Removal</h3>
          <p>Physical removal of mold-damaged materials and thorough cleaning of remaining surfaces.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Damaged material removal</li>
            <li>HEPA vacuuming</li>
            <li>Antimicrobial treatment</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/mold-removal/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Related</span>
          <h3>Water Damage &amp; Mold</h3>
          <p>Address the moisture source and resulting mold after leaks, floods, or storm damage.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Leak &amp; moisture source control</li>
            <li>Drying &amp; dehumidification</li>
            <li>Mold prevention steps</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/water-damage-mold/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Testing</span>
          <h3>Air Quality Testing</h3>
          <p>Indoor air sampling to evaluate spore levels and support decisions about remediation or clearance.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Indoor &amp; outdoor samples</li>
            <li>Lab analysis</li>
            <li>Clear reporting</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/air-quality-testing/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Prevention</span>
          <h3>Prevention &amp; Maintenance</h3>
          <p>Guidance and services to reduce humidity, fix moisture sources, and keep mold from coming back.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Humidity control tips</li>
            <li>Source repair advice</li>
            <li>Follow-up checks</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/prevention-maintenance/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section" id="process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How We Restore <span>Clean Air</span></h2>
        <p>Every Fort Pierce mold job follows a structured, transparent process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Call &amp; Schedule</h3>
          <p>Call or text. We confirm your appointment quickly — often same-day — and gather a brief description of what you’re seeing or smelling.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Inspection &amp; Assessment</h3>
          <p>We inspect the property, check moisture, map affected areas, and determine whether sampling is needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Clear Findings &amp; Quote</h3>
          <p>You receive a plain-language explanation of findings and a written estimate before any remediation begins. No pressure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Remediation</h3>
          <p>With your approval we set up containment, remove contaminated materials, clean, and treat surfaces.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Verification</h3>
          <p>We confirm the work is complete and leave you with a summary and prevention recommendations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Map / Location -->
  <section class="section map-section" id="location">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="map-grid">
        <div class="map-info">
          <h2>Find Us in Fort Pierce, FL</h2>
          <p>Proudly serving Fort Pierce and all of St. Lucie County from our location on Okeechobee Road.</p>
          <p class="map-address">📍 3706 Okeechobee Rd, Fort Pierce, FL 34947</p>
          <p>Serving Fort Pierce · Port St. Lucie · Hutchinson Island · Lakewood Park · White City · Indian River Estates and surrounding communities.</p>
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1rem">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
        </div>
        <div class="map-embed">
          <iframe
            title="Fort Pierce Mold Specialists location"
            src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-80.3456%2C27.4267%2C-80.3056%2C27.4667&amp;layer=mapnik&amp;marker=27.4467%2C-80.3256"
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Mold in Your Fort Pierce Home?</h2>
      <p>Don’t ignore musty smells or visible growth. If you suspect mold, our team can respond quickly with a professional inspection and clear next steps.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Mold Questions <span>Answered</span></h2>
        <p>Real answers to what Fort Pierce homeowners ask most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Is visible mold an emergency?</h3>
          <p>Yes when it is spreading, associated with a recent leak or flood, or affecting people with respiratory issues or compromised immunity. Early assessment prevents larger remediation jobs and protects health.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How much does mold remediation cost in Fort Pierce?</h3>
          <p>Cost depends on the size of the affected area, materials involved, and whether structural drying is needed. We provide a written estimate after inspection — never a surprise bill.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you test for mold as well as remove it?</h3>
          <p>Yes. We offer inspection and testing when appropriate, and full remediation. Testing helps confirm the scope and can support clearance after the job.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Are you licensed and insured in Florida?</h3>
          <p>Yes. All work is performed by licensed, insured specialists familiar with Florida humidity, coastal properties, and local building conditions in St. Lucie County.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I clean mold myself?</h3>
          <p>Small surface spots on non-porous materials can sometimes be cleaned carefully, but larger growth, porous materials (drywall, insulation), or suspected black mold should be handled by professionals to avoid spreading spores and incomplete removal.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
